<section class="gifts" id="gifts">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">买就送，赠品价值超百元！</h2>
    
    <div class="gift-grid">
      <!-- 起泡网（每盒） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_bubble_net.png' | asset_url }}" alt="起泡网">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">起泡网 <span class="gift-condition">（每盒）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">轻松打出绵密泡沫，深层清洁毛孔，让每一次洁面都成为享受。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 沥水皂盒（购买两盒赠送） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_drain_box.png' | asset_url }}" alt="沥水皂盒">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">沥水皂盒 <span class="gift-condition">（购买两盒赠送）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">双层镂空沥水设计，有效保持皂体干燥清爽，延长手工皂使用寿命。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 气垫按摩梳（购买三盒赠送价值） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_air_cushion_comb.png' | asset_url }}" alt="气垫按摩梳">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">气垫按摩梳 <span class="gift-condition">（购买三盒赠送价值）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">高弹性气囊梳齿，温柔贴合头皮，有效缓解疲劳，促进头部血液循环。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.gifts { padding: 80px 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d4a2a 0%, #4a7c3f 50%, #2d4a2a 100%); }
.gifts .section-title { color: #fff; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }

.gift-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 32px;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.gift-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
}
.gift-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.gift-img { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.gift-img img {
  width: 160px;
  height: 160px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
  margin: 0 auto;
  border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

.gift-name {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.gift-condition {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.gift-desc {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .gift-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Gifts",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Gifts" }]
}
{% endschema %}
